  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PERFORMANCE-BASED PARTNERSHIP SCHEME FOCUSING ON QUALITY PROGRAMMING, UNDERSTANDING CHANGE AND RESULTS FOR POOR HOUSEHOLDS AND COMMUNITIES</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NOURISH empowers communities to preserve, protect and enhance their natural environment through natural resource managed measures and land management in the Makira- Ulawa Province, Solomon Islands.

The principle aim of this objective is reduce the vulnerability to climate change impacts by increasing the adoption of sustainable management, utilisation and conservation of natural resources in target communities increasing their ability to adapt to, or absorb, climate change stresses, shocks and variability and by helping reduce exposure to them.</narrative>
  </description>
